---
const rejected = `{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "req-1",
  "result": {
    "task": {
      "contextId": "ctx-42",
      "status": {
        "state": "TASK_STATE_REJECTED",
        "message": {
          "role": "ROLE_AGENT",
          "parts": [{ "text": "Blocked by guardrail …" }]
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "guardrailHub": {
          "blocked": true,
          "stage": "input",
          "trace": [ … ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}`
---

<section id="a2a" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6">
  <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-16">
    <div class="max-w-md">
      <h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance">
        Your app changes one URL.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Agents and the hub both speak the open{' '}
        <a
          class="text-teal underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-teal-dark"
          href="https://a2a-protocol.org/v1.0.0/specification/">A2A 1.0</a
        >{' '}
        protocol. The guarded URL serves the same Agent Card and accepts the same{' '}
        <code class="font-mono text-[0.875em]">SendMessage</code>{' '}
        call as the agent behind it, so any A2A client switches over without code changes.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        A blocked call comes back as an ordinary rejected task with the reason. The trace rides
        along in{' '}
        <code class="font-mono text-[0.875em]">metadata</code>, and clients that don’t know about
        it ignore it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid min-w-0 gap-4">
      <div class="diff on-dark" aria-label="Configuration change">
        <pre><code><span class="del">- AGENT_URL=https://support-bot.internal.acme.dev</span>
<span class="add">+ AGENT_URL=https://hub.acme.dev/a/support-bot</span>
<span class="add">+ AGENT_API_KEY=ghk_••••••••••••</span></code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="diff on-dark">
        <pre><code>{rejected}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .diff {
    background: var(--color-console);
    color: #d6d8dc;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .diff pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .del {
    color: var(--color-danger-bright);
  }

  .add {
    color: var(--color-teal-bright);
  }
</style>
